{"path":"biology/genetics/mendel/mendel","title":"遗传规律","type":"knowledge","html":"<h1>遗传规律</h1>\n<h2>两大定律（孟德尔）</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>分离定律</strong>：等位基因随同源染色体分开而分离（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Aa\\to A:a=1:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>）；</li>\n<li><strong>自由组合定律</strong>：非同源染色体上的非等位基因自由组合（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AaBb</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span> 产生 4 种配子 1:1:1:1）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>9331 与变式（选填杀手锏）</h2>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AaBb\\times AaBb</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span> 标准：<strong>9:3:3:1</strong>，变式全表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>比例</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>9:7</td>\n<td>双显性 A_B_ 一种性状，其余一种（互补）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9:3:4</td>\n<td>双显一种，单显（A_bb）一种，其余（aaB_+aabb）一种</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9:6:1</td>\n<td>双显一种，单显两种合并，双隐一种（累加）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15:1</td>\n<td>只要有显性基因就是同一性状</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12:3:1</td>\n<td>显性上位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13:3</td>\n<td>抑制基因</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>拆分法</strong>（邪修核心）：9:3:3:1 = (3:1)×(3:1)，任何变式都能拆成两对基因独立遗传——看到&quot;16 份&quot;就是两对基因。</p>\n<h2>伴性遗传</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>伴 X 隐性</strong>（红绿色盲、血友病）：男患者多；女患者的父亲和儿子必患病；&quot;交叉遗传&quot;（外公→女儿→外孙）；</li>\n<li><strong>伴 X 显性</strong>（抗 VD 佝偻病）：女患者多；男患者的母亲和女儿必患病；</li>\n<li><strong>伴 Y</strong>：只传男（外耳道多毛症）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>系谱图判断口诀</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>无中生有为隐性</strong>（父母正常生患病孩子 → 隐性）；\n<strong>有中生无为显性</strong>（父母患病生正常孩子 → 显性）；\n隐性遗传看女病：女病父子病 → 伴 X 隐性；\n显性遗传看男病：男病母女病 → 伴 X 显性。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>概率计算模板</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>分离比法：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Aa\\times Aa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span> → <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AA:Aa:aa=1:2:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">AA</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">aa</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>，患病概率 1/4（隐性）；</li>\n<li>自由组合拆分：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AaBb\\times AaBb</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span> → 先拆两对分别算再相乘；</li>\n<li>&quot;患病男孩&quot; vs &quot;男孩患病&quot;：前者 ×1/2，后者不乘（性别已知）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>邪修提示</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>比例题：<strong>数总份数</strong>——16 份两对基因，4 份一对基因（性状分离 3:1 或 1:2:1）；</li>\n<li>9331 变式：先写标准 9:3:3:1，再按题目合并（9:3:4 = 3+1 合并）——别重推；</li>\n<li>系谱图：口诀两句话定位显隐性，再套&quot;看女病/男病&quot;定位染色体；</li>\n<li>风险：&quot;自由组合&quot;必须有&quot;非同源染色体&quot;前提（一对染色体上的两对基因连锁，不自由组合）。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":null,"evilHtml":null,"meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":["分离定律","自由组合","9331","伴性遗传","系谱图"],"summary":"遗传规律 两大定律（孟德尔） 分离定律 ：等位基因随同源染色体分开而分离（ A a → A : a = 1 : 1 Aa\\to A:a=1:1 A a → A : a = 1 : 1 ）； 自由组合定律 ：非同源染色体上的非等位基因自由组合","fit":[],"updated":"Wed Feb 05 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"genetics","title":"遗传与进化"},{"slug":"mendel","title":"遗传规律"},{"slug":"mendel","title":"遗传规律"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"epistasis-12-3-1","title":"显性上位 12:3:1（9+3 合并）","type":"example"},{"slug":"epistasis-homozygous","title":"上位效应中的纯合比例（单显 1/3）","type":"example"},{"slug":"experiment-design-multiple","title":"显隐性判断测交（全黑 vs 出现白）","type":"example"},{"slug":"gene-location","title":"基因定位实验（正反交判断）","type":"example"},{"slug":"genetic-9331","title":"9331 变式比例（拆分法）","type":"example"},{"slug":"lethal-ratio","title":"显性纯合致死比例（筛除 1/4）","type":"example"},{"slug":"multi-gene-types","title":"遗传多对基因·比值变式全表与题眼","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"two-disease-prob","title":"常染色体+伴X 两病概率（拆分相乘）","type":"example"},{"slug":"two-gene-ratio","title":"两对基因概率（拆分法）","type":"example"}]}